-- WELL-FOUNDED WORLDS AND TICKS (w_agg_wfs_ticks; docs/aggregates.md,
-- "Well-founded worlds and ticks, as built"). The wfs column: a cell under
-- semantics(well_founded) is refused (each world's `-refused-` fixtures),
-- and a well-founded world below is read by a stratified one above it
-- (`-- below:` in a file: rofl-load --below, Session::feed_below). The world
-- below is declared on its own too, so both engines agree on what is fed.
