-- SUBSUMPTION (w_agg_subsumption): `p(K..., V1...) <= p(K..., V2...) :- Body.`,
-- a cell per key holding the antichain of the values none of the values it
-- was given dominates; the dominance ordinary rofl over closed relations,
-- rules as data; the consequences of a dominated value withdrawn, and a
-- consumer not monotone in the dominance refused on the facts it made; the
-- Antichain witness; a conflict for a dominance that is no strict partial
-- order. docs/aggregates.md, "Subsumption, as built".
