-- THE TYPESCRIPT ENGINE (w_agg_ts, docs/aggregates.md, "The TypeScript engine,
-- as built"). Every world above is loaded together (`together`) and answered
-- by both engines, and facts/goldens.rofl pins the one hash both reach. A
-- kind's eval world proves it evaluates in TypeScript and its why world that
-- the two agree on its witness and its explanations, each red under a
-- TypeScript fault (`ts_*` in scripts/agg_breaks.ts).
